{"title": "Psionic Retribution", "pageid": 25569, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psionic_Retribution", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/300px-Generic_Psychic.webp, /w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/300px-Generic_Psychic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Psionic Retribution</b> is a toggleable passive feature available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a> that lets it release a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Retributive_Brainquake\" title=\"Retributive Brainquake\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Retributive Brainquake\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Retributive_Brainquake\" title=\"Retributive Brainquake\">Retributive Brainquake</a> as a reaction to taking damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The Netherbrain permits no interference - as a reaction to taking damage, it releases Brainquakes. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Netherbrain\" title=\"The Netherbrain\">The Netherbrain</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202927\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 735/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4425/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2147/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 148/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 675684/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.817      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   33.817      1 -total\n 46.40%   15.692      1 Template:PageSeo\n 45.23%   15.297      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.